Class based component at the end is a class

The most important part of your class base component is a render method.You cannot create a class base component without render method.This render method returns a Jsx

=>How to access props in class component:
We can access props like this.props.name

Example:
import React from "react";

class ProfileComponent extends React.Component {
  render() {
    return (
      <div>
        ProfileComponent <h1>{this.props.userName}</h1>{" "}
      </div>
    );
  }
}
export default ProfileComponent;

When we pass props in class base components, react will collect all this props and will attached it to this of ProfileComponent class.

