What is the difference btw componentDidMount and componentDidUpdate? (Point why this difference not occur in function component because useEffect in function component why state is called also after first render)
The major difference is that componentDidMount will  called only after first  render and componentDidUpdate will called after every next render(excluding the first render).This thing is very easy in functional component by useEffect.If we give empty dependency array then that is equilvalent to componentDidMount and if we give dependency data,then that is equilvalent to componentDidUpdate
